        'rawContent': '{{Aircraft Information|\r\n|image = [[Image:Cinaed_Neoframe_Project_Standard_View.png|150px]]\r\n|caption =\r\n|name = Neoframe Prototype\r\n|mission_profile =Vertical Take-Off and Landing Air and Space Multirole Fighter\r\n|crew = 1 pilot\r\n|first_flight = [[2340]]\r\n|manufacturer =  TBA\r\n|operator = TBA\r\n|variants = TBA\r\n|length = TBA\r\n|wingspan = TBA\r\n|height = TBA\r\n|powerplant =1 x 115mW Fusion Reactor\r\n|propulsion =1 x SJ-7r Scramjet<br/>1 x GCD-4r Gravity Cavitation Drive\r\n|controls =Aeroelastic Control Surface for Atmospheric Flight\r\n|avionics =TBA\r\n|sensors =TBA\r\n|communications =TBA\r\n|max_airspeed =28.6\r\n|cruising_airspeed =2250\r\n|acceleration_rate =55.8\r\n|max_velocity =500\r\n|operation_time = 22\r\n|fixed_weapons =2 x Cannons<br/>8 x Missile Pods\r\n|variable_payload =2 x Medium Hard Points<br/>1 x Heavy Hard Point\r\n|armor = TBA\r\n|shields = TBA\r\n|countermeasures = TBA\r\n}}\r\n\r\nThe Cinaed Accords were a technological and cultural exchange program between the [[Mesarthrim Federation]] and the [[Federated Districts of the Prefecture]].  One of several projects was the TA001-"Neoframe".\r\n\r\nThe Neoframe Project was designed to share airframe, propulsion, power production, and navigation technologies, while allowing each government to equip armaments and defenses suitable to their own tactics and logistics support.\r\n\r\nThe design shared the sparrow-tailed engine profile characteristic of Mesarthrim designs, while it built on a more conventional looking forward frame typical of Terran designs.\r\n\r\n[[Image:Cinaed_Neoframe_Project_Side_View.png|150px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Cinaed_Neoframe_Project_Top_View.png|150px]]\r\n\r\n[[Image:Cinaed_Neoframe_Project_Front_View.png|150px]]\r\n\r\n[[Category:Fighters]]\r\n[[Category:Aircraft]]'
