        'rawContent': "{{Aircraft Information|\r\n|image = [[Image:Km-5 Drache.png|250px]]\r\n|caption =\r\n|name = Km-5 Drache\r\n|mission_profile = Air and Space Superiority Fighter\r\n|crew = 1 pilot\r\n|first_flight = May 4th, [[2340]]\r\n|manufacturer = [[Schwarzestein Schiffswerften]]\r\n|operator = [[Mesarthrim Federation Kriegsmarine|Kriegsmarine]]\r\n|variants = [[Km-5 Drache#Km-5A|Km-5A Drache-Ritter]]\r\n|length = \r\n|wingspan = \r\n|height= \r\n|powerplant = 1 x [[Strauss Energie]] [[Muon-katalysiert Fusion Reactor]]\r\n|propulsion = 1 x [[Zukünftige Designs]] [[Gravity Variance Drive]]\r\n|controls = [[Zukünftige Designs]] [[Aeroelastic Control Surface for Atmospheric Flight]]\r\n|avionics = [[Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]] [[Nachtferd#Vogel-Ansicht|Nachtpferd Vogel-Ansicht]]\r\n|sensors = [[Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]] [[Dialogkommunikation]]\r\n|communications = [[Mesar Schnittstelle Gruppe]] [[Rotes Auge]]\r\n|max_airspeed =28.6\r\n|cruising_airspeed =2250\r\n|acceleration_rate =55.8\r\n|max_velocity =500\r\n|operation_time =22 \r\n|fixed_weapons = 2 x Type-XB [[Blazer|Blazers]]\r\n|variable_payload = 2 x Medium Ordinance Hardpoints<br/><small>''(typically)'' 2 x DD-03 Pursuit Missiles</small><br />2 x Four Round Light Missile Pods<br/><small>''(typically)'' 8 x DL-75 IR/Guided Missiles</small>\r\n|armor = [[Mysterium-Stahl]] [[Leifstein Folded Composite Armor|Leifstein Gefaltete Zerlegbare Rüstung]]\r\n|shields = [[Zweiundzwanzig]] [[Branch Predictive Adaptive Shielding]]\r\n|countermeasures = [[Zweiundzwanzig]] [[Base-7 ARCH E/PCM]]\r\n}}\r\nThe Km-5 Drache is the [[Mesarthrim Federation|Mesarthrim Federations]] version of the [[Cinaed Accords]] [[Cinaed Neoframe Project|TA001-Neoframe]].  At the request of the [[Mesarthrim Federation Kriegsmarine|Kriegsmarine]], [[Schwarzestein Schiffswerften]] exercised the option to purchase manufacturing rights from the Cinead Accords.  Production of the model began instantly.  [[Prefecture]] analysts observed the Neoframe's progress and exercised their own purchasing rights later that year.\r\n\r\n==History==\r\n\r\n==Development==\r\n\r\n==Design==\r\n===General Characteristics===\r\n===Performance===\r\n===Armament===\r\n===Avionics===\r\n\r\n==Operational History==\r\n\r\n==Operators==\r\n\r\n==Variants==\r\n\r\n\r\n[[Category:Fighters]]"
